<title>SINGAPORE: GK Goh unit director sells 75,000 shares.</title>
<headline>GK Goh unit director sells 75,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroker GK Goh Holdings said on Wednesday that Gan Tee Jin, a director of its unit GK Goh Research Pte Ltd, has sold all his 75,000 shares in the subsidiary.</p>
<p>It said in a statement Gan sold 12,000 shares at Singapore S$1.803 each and 63,000 shares at S$1.801 each. It gave no further details</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
